{"t":"PNW","made":"2026-11-26 02:57","name":"Pinnacle West Capital Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":6610,"hq":"Phoenix, AZ, United States","website":"https://www.pinnaclewest.com","summary_en":"Pinnacle West Capital Corporation, through its subsidiary, provides retail and wholesale electric services in the state of Arizona. The company engages in the generation, transmission, and distribution of electricity using nuclear, gas, oil, coal, and solar generating facilities. Its transmission facilities include overhead lines and underground lines; and distribution facilities consist of overhead lines and underground primary cables. The company also owns and maintains substations, including transmission and distribution yards; and owns energy storage facilities. Pinnacle West Capital Corporation was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Pinnacle West Capital Corporation은 자회사를 통해 애리조나 주에서 소매 및 도매 전기 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 원자력, 가스, 석유, 석탄, 태양광 발전 시설을 이용하여 전력을 생산, 송전 및 배전하는 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 전송 시설에는 가공선과 지하선이 포함됩니다. 배전시설은 가공선과 지하 1차케이블로 구성됩니다. 또한 회사는 송전 및 배전 야드를 포함한 변전소를 소유하고 유지 관리합니다. 에너지 저장시설을 보유하고 있습니다. Pinnacle West Capital Corporation은 1985년에 설립되었으며 애리조나주 피닉스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":102.9732,"mcap":12480476160.0,"pe":19.355864,"fpe":18.410822,"peg":3.6299,"ps":2.1871555,"pb":1.6686631,"ev_ebitda":13.294,"div":3.62,"beta":0.473,"hi52":111.16,"lo52":86.18},"fin":{"rev":5706258944.0,"rev_g":0.083,"eps_g":0.03,"gross":0.43842,"op":0.20944999,"net":0.11586001,"roe":0.09094,"fcf":-997653888.0,"cash":11124000.0,"debt":16966884352.0,"de":225.576,"eps":5.32,"feps":5.59308},"own":{"short":0.1351,"inst":1.1381301,"insider":0.00145},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":106.0,"median":107.0,"high":123.0,"low":89.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.44444,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy"